{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jetty/jetty.project/compare/jetty-12.1.x...b5bdc24629cac46ed51c12de11afd7a068cb3b48","html_url":"https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/compare/jetty-12.1.x...b5bdc24629cac46ed51c12de11afd7a068cb3b48","permalink_url":"https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/compare/jetty:8e53d72...jetty:b5bdc24","diff_url":"https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/compare/jetty-12.1.x...b5bdc24629cac46ed51c12de11afd7a068cb3b48.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/compare/jetty-12.1.x...b5bdc24629cac46ed51c12de11afd7a068cb3b48.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"8e53d721c32480683d6787345c07478b7a00274d","node_id":"C_kwDOAB81F9oAKDhlNTNkNzIxYzMyNDgwNjgzZDY3ODczNDVjMDc0NzhiN2EwMDI3NGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Joakim Erdfelt","email":"joakim.erdfelt@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-19T15:39:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"Joakim Erdfelt","email":"joakim.erdfelt@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-20T19:19:39Z"},"message":"Proxy relays response headers verbatim\n\nSince 12.1.12 the servlet proxies re-serialized each upstream response\nheader by splitting it on commas and re-joining, which corrupted or\ndropped values that are not RFC 9110 comma-lists. Relay the stored value\nas-is instead.\n\nHttpField.getValueList() runs a QuotedCSV parse (comma-split,\nkeepQuotes=false), wrong for single-value headers that legitimately\ncontain commas or quotes:\n\n- Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"sample,document.doc\" parsed\n  fine but came back stripped of its quotes, inner comma, and the space\n  after ';', so browsers rejected the download.\n- Permissions-Policy and other RFC 9651 structured fields threw\n  IllegalArgumentException (BAD_QUOTES_IN_TOKEN). The throw escaped the\n  headers listener, got swallowed at INFO by ResponseListeners, and\n  aborted the copy loop, silently dropping every later header (including\n  Content-Encoding) while the compressed body was still relayed.\n\nReplace String.join(\", \", newHttpField.getValueList()) with\nnewHttpField.getValue() in onServerResponseHeaders, restoring the\nverbatim relay the proxy did before \"Fixes #577\". The duplicate-line\npreservation from the #15531 fix (the seenResponseHeaders set/add block)\nis independent and untouched, so repeated header lines are still\nemitted separately.\n\nee8-proxy regenerates from ee9-proxy, so only ee9, ee10, and ee11 are\nedited here.\n\nCloses #15853\nCloses #15965","tree":{"sha":"fe9df8f3c7463fe7908a5f8a2f0f7011382f276d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jetty/jetty.project/git/trees/fe9df8f3c7463fe7908a5f8a2f0f7011382f276d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jetty/jetty.project/git/commits/8e53d721c32480683d6787345c07478b7a00274d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jetty/jetty.project/commits/8e53d721c32480683d6787345c07478b7a00274d","html_url":"https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/commit/8e53d721c32480683d6787345c07478b7a00274d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jetty/jetty.project/commits/8e53d721c32480683d6787345c07478b7a00274d/comments","author":{"login":"joakime","id":191721,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTcyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191721?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime","html_url":"https://github.com/joakime","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joakime/received